    claim: "gRPC over HTTP/2 with interceptors and mutual TLS",
    where: "CV → Core Competencies, mục 4 (\"REST API design and documentation\"), vế cuối; đối chiếu CV → Leeon Group, gạch đầu dòng 4 (\"worked with gRPC in depth (mutual TLS, interceptors, streaming)\")",
